削除する","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":1252,"spelling":"√ӟ-д-ф"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":5,"spelling":"‹катө̂п›"}]}]},{"id":"69775c2894ee2e3066c2ca87","number":1588,"spelling":"заду̂ффе","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["敵対する","敵視する","仇なす","争う"],"termString":"[С に] 敵対する, 敵視する, 仇なす, 争う","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false},{"titles":["形容詞","分詞"],"terms":["敵対的な","敵意のある"],"termString":"敵対的な, 敵意のある","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["類義語"],"number":1796,"spelling":"каде̂"},{"titles":["類義語"],"number":1581,"spelling":"кодкаху̂з"}]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":1252,"spelling":"√ӟ-д-ф"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":72,"spelling":"‹катө̂ппе›"}]}]},{"id":"69493f70ba31b505c24506a6","number":1575,"spelling":"зази̂х","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["撒く","散らす","散布する"],"termString":"[Х を С に] 撒く, 散らす, 散布する","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["言いふらす","言い広める","言い散らす"],"termString":"[Х を С に] 言いふらす, 言い広める, 言い散らす","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"語義","text":"その必要がないにも関わらず様々な人に情報を伝えることを表す。\nネガティブなニュアンスがある。","hidden":false}],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":1574,"spelling":"√ӟ-ӟ-х"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":5,"spelling":"‹катө̂п›"}]}]},{"id":"6a05289b5d6b59067b391c50","number":537,"spelling":"зале̂","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["いる","ある","持つ"],"termString":"[Т が, Х が] いる, ある, 持つ","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"語法","text":"対格項をとった場合は、主語がそれを所有していることを表す。\n一方で具格項をとった場合は、主格のものに関連して具格のものが存在していることを表す。\nただし、両者に明確な区別があるわけではなく、同じ名詞でも対格項になったり具格項になったりすることがある。\n「兄弟」や「友達」など人の関係性を表す単語や、「時間」のような抽象的な概念は、具格で表されることが多い。\n一方、「ペン」などの具体的な物は、対格で表されることが多い。","hidden":false},{"title":"語法","text":"目的語には節が置かれることもあり、その場合は主語のものに関連してその節の内容が成立していることを表す。","hidden":false},{"title":"語法","text":"「いない」などの否定の意味には、この単語が否定表現とともに使われる代わりに、[{же̂в}](@#1343) が用いられることもある。","hidden":false},{"title":"類義語","text":"⟪[{зале̂}](@#537), [{ваду̂е}](@#675)⟫\n{зале̂} も {ваду̂е} も所有を意味するが、{ваду̂е} の方が「財産として所有している」という意味合いが強い。","hidden":false}],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["類義語"],"number":675,"spelling":"ваду̂е"},{"titles":["対義語"],"number":1343,"spelling":"же̂в"}]},{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["してある","している","してしまう"],"termString":"[Е′ を] してある, している, してしまう","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"語法","text":"主語と同格の分詞を伴って完了相を表す。","hidden":false}],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":536,"spelling":"√ӟ-л-ў"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":5,"spelling":"‹катө̂п›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":196,"spelling":"‹=и›"}]}]},{"id":"69b3f8872f18f4b13cbe80d6","number":903,"spelling":"залу̂е","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["ままにする","保つ"],"termString":"[Х を Х′ の] ままにする, 保つ","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"語法","text":"同格の対格補語が省略されて、「そのままの状態に保つ」の意味で使われることもある。","hidden":false}],"phrases":[{"titles":[],"expression":"залу̂ала","terms":["待って"],"termString":"待って","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","text":"何らかの意味で先に進んでしまいそうな状況を一度止めようとするときに発される。\n緊迫度が小さい場合は {ти̂жно̀ӈ} 等の修飾語が付くこともある。","hidden":false}],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["続ける","継続する"],"termString":"[Х を] 続ける, 継続する","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["類義語"],"number":2042,"spelling":"фаду̂н"}]},{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["留める","動かないようにする"],"termString":"[Х を] 留める, 動かないようにする","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":536,"spelling":"√ӟ-л-ў"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":72,"spelling":"‹катө̂ппе›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"69e6263fd1a028f54c835f3f","number":1995,"spelling":"залу̂ез","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["ままになる","保たれる"],"termString":"[Е′ の] ままになる, 保たれる","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["続く","継続する"],"termString":"(状態や現象が) 続く, 継続する","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":536,"spelling":"√ӟ-л-ў"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":72,"spelling":"‹катө̂ппе›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":70,"spelling":"‹-ҙ›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"689ffac44420597dd70ba69c","number":452,"spelling":"зами̂в","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["動詞"],"terms":["遅れる","遅刻する","遅延する"],"termString":"遅れる, 遅刻する, 遅延する","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]