лфо","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["名詞","青類"],"terms":["飛行機"],"termString":"飛行機","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":150,"spelling":"√х-л-ф"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":35,"spelling":"‹кө̂тап›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":746,"spelling":"‹-ос-›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"68dd425e3502934183bfaf57","number":339,"spelling":"ху̂ак","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["名詞","赤類"],"terms":["卵","玉子"],"termString":"卵, 玉子","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"メモ","text":"「肉」や「魚」を意味する単語には、食べ物としてのニュアンスがあるものと動物 (かその一部) のニュアンスがあるものとで 2 つある。\nこれを踏まえると、「卵」についても 2 単語があっても良さそうだと感じはした。\nだが、食べ物でない卵に言及することが日常でそれほどない気がするため、1 単語のみ作成し、デフォルトでは食べ物のニュアンスがあるものの動物組織としての卵も指すことにした。","hidden":true}],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":247,"spelling":"√х-ў-к"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":7,"spelling":"‹кө̂ттап›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"689ffbc04420597dd70c08d7","number":564,"spelling":"ху̂ватте","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["形容詞"],"terms":["怖い","恐ろしい"],"termString":"怖い, 恐ろしい","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":97,"spelling":"√х-в-т"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":24,"spelling":"‹кө̂тaппе›"}]}]},{"id":"689ffbc04420597dd70c091d","number":866,"spelling":"ху̂дао","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["名詞","青類"],"terms":["後","以後"],"termString":"[М の] (時間的に) 後, 以後","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["対義語"],"number":867,"spelling":"ну̂чаммо"}]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":234,"spelling":"√х-д-ъ"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":24,"spelling":"‹кө̂тaппе›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"69dcd6993f6aef0184a96928","number":1499,"spelling":"ху̂кке","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["形容詞"],"terms":["若い","新しい"],"termString":"若い, 新しい","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false},{"titles":["名詞","両類"],"terms":["若者","青年"],"termString":"若者, 青年","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|⟨.*?⟩|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[{"title":"語義","text":"形容詞用法では、それそのものが生み出されてからの時間が短いことを指し、人も物も被修飾語になり得る。\n単独で名詞として用いられた場合は、専ら「若い人」すなわち「若者」を指す。","hidden":false},{"title":"類義語","text":"⟪[{ху̂кке}](@#1499), [{чи̂се}](@#2211)⟫\n{ху̂кке} の方が、「若い」の意味で一般に用いられる。\n{чи̂се} には、それに加えて「活き活きしている」のようなポジティブなニュアンスが加わる。\nなお、{ху̂кке} は人以外の物も修飾するが、{чи̂се} は人しか修飾しない。","hidden":false}],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["類義語"],"number":258,"spelling":"фи̂лан"},{"titles":["対義語"],"number":1503,"spelling":"ҕу̂намме"},{"titles":["類義語"],"number":2211,"spelling":"чи̂се"}]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":247,"spelling":"√х-ў-к"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":24,"spelling":"‹кө̂тaппе›"},{"titles":["語型"],"number":197,"spelling":"‹=у›"}]}]},{"id":"689ffbc14420597dd70c0a64","number":217,"spelling":"ху̂лаф","pronunciation":"","tags":["単語"],"sections":[{"equivalents":[{"titles":["名詞","赤類"],"terms":["鳥","鳥類"],"termString":"鳥, 鳥類","ignoredPattern":"\\(.*?\\)|\\[.*?\\]|～","hidden":false}],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[]},{"equivalents":[],"informations":[],"phrases":[],"variations":[],"relations":[{"titles":["語根"],"number":1